  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-13T12:11:26.472Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are many markers that have been created by the community (Snail and NoeNoe's come to mind) , but they often have syncing problems where people can't read others writing; also anyone who joins a room later, never syncs the writing. \n\nIt would be fantastic if we could get an option to add a sync marker via SDK prefab with a whitelisted marker script.   ( Preferably one that has been optimized to avoid the 'dot attack' trolling that runs rampant in Presentation Room). \n\nBonus points if it has an option for color-picking.",
